<<has entity=`example` name=`the-verdict` params=`mu/sword ~ one verdict for the hearth, the worn daemon wiki and the asker's face, its exit code beside it`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`the-residue` params=`mu/pentacle ~ owed mirrors, pending removals, begun halves`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`the-checklist` params=`mu/precision aperture/arc ~ the pre-restand checklist in one call, the verdict's exit beside it`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`one-line` params=`mu/sword aperture/pulse ~ one line asserted, a spirit's cheapest check`>>
```

