!! takes ~ mu · aperture · face · mandate

<<~ kahea uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance#/takes/mu`>>
<<~ kahea uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance#/takes/aperture`>>

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`aperture` params=`takes/range skins/console,cli default/beat ~ the range; this door's default reads 6/beat: the status line, the pins and the keys`>>
<<has entity=`cell` name=`00` params=`mu/rest ~ the ground: the status line, the layered pins, the keys`>>
<<has entity=`cell` name=`*0` params=`mu/wand via/[[lares wiki status]] ~ every lit wiki and its islands, lit or dark`>>
<<has entity=`cell` name=`?0` params=`mu/cup via/[[lares vessel roster]] ~ the relation map: who holds each face and seat, and how the worn face reaches each wiki`>>
<<has entity=`cell` name=`!0` params=`mu/sword ~ one verdict with an exit code for three: the hearth, the worn face's daemon wiki, the asker's own face; dark answers 1 as a report, and a spirit that reads it waits on the house's next event`>>
<<has entity=`cell` name=`_0` params=`mu/pentacle via/[[lares shore]],[[lares rite receipts]] ~ the hidden residue: owed mirrors and pending removals, begun halves`>>
<<has entity=`cell` name=`*!` params=`mu/detail ~ the board verified: every lit wiki, then the verdict`>>
<<has entity=`cell` name=`*?` params=`mu/relation ~ the live graph: every lit wiki beside the relation map`>>
<<has entity=`cell` name=`_!` params=`mu/precision ~ the pre-restand checklist: the residue, then the verdict and its exit`>>
<<has entity=`cell` name=`_?` params=`mu/overview ~ what the residue would block: each line naming the act it holds back`>>
<<has entity=`cell` name=`*_` params=`mu/signal-jam ~ an explicit debug dump: every lit wiki and the residue, every door at once`>>
<<has entity=`cell` name=`?!` params=`mu/dubious-move ~ the relation map answered with a warning: relations read on trust, the verdict named as the next call`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/handle ~ the lit face the read rides; the verdict reads that face's own standing`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`mandate` params=`takes/title ~ the mandate record whose pins field layers above the face's; absent, LARES_MANDATE names it`>>
```

